    "description": "YouTube Source : 印度馬友友在台灣 An Indian in Taiwan Looking for the best place near 101  to catch Taipei’s stunning skyline? Xiangshan, also known as Elephant Mountain, is a must-visit spot when you travel to Taiwan . Nestled in the southeastern part of Taipei, this iconic hiking trail offers breathtaking city views and has become a favorite destination for both locals and travelers. From beginners to seasoned hikers, everyone can enjoy the beauty of Taipei from above. MRT Red Line - Xiangshan The...",
